155`: when the stats storage module has no `EditorStat`, the fallback builds `editorStat` from the editor-data module instead. It looks like a copy-paste bug.\n- The four SQL dialects share `baseConnector.js`, so a change there has to work in all of them.\n\n**Not done:**\n- **No friction line.** I didn't append to `.theseus/scoreboard/friction.jsonl`: it's outside the target, and a fourth changed file would break the packet's 3-file budget.\n- **No follow-up packets requested.** The card's Open questions (who produces `graph.json`, the missing file, the line-155 fallback, splitting `DocsCoServer.js`) are candidates for follow-up investigate packets.\n\n**Lessons for the Atlas:**\n- Run the graph and metrics tools before the cartography packets. Otherwise every card ships with empty tool fields.\n- No tests were found for `DocsCoServer.js`, `canvasservice.js`, `converterservice.js` or `wopiClient.js`. That's the biggest gap in the oracle for this module.","ttft_ms":2694,"type":"result","duration_ms":55089,"uuid":"d1c288e5-cf03-4db8-a1ce-90bde4e93538","ttft_stream_ms":1443,"time_to_request_ms":799,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":8,"system_prompt":612,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":5,"input_attachments":30,"input_hooks":3,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":27,"tool_pool_refresh":1,"init_message":10,"init_frame_send":4,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":5,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":3,"request_announcements":16,"query_setup":5,"auto_mode_context_wait":11,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":35,"message_normalization":3,"client_creation":5,"request_build":12},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":85,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":362,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":215,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":140,"process_rss_mib_result":239,"process_anon_mib_result":150,"process_peak_rss_mib":239,"process_cpu_ms_turn":2456,"process_wall_ms_turn":55089,"process_cpu_ms_s